          "jcr:created": "Mon Jul 31 2023 14:08:13 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<p>Chair and CEO Kevin Lobo joins the InsideOut podcast with Mike Alkire, CEO of Premier Inc., to discuss Stryker’s post-pandemic growth, including how innovation is embedded within the company’s culture and the strong focus we have on supporting our customers by building supply chain resiliency. The podcast aims to highlight the solutions needed to help drive innovation and solve complex problems in healthcare.&nbsp;</p>\n",
